<!--
  TRAP 1, verified live 2026-08-05.

  https://www.acemakerspace.org/calendar/feed/ answers **HTTP 404** with a
  populated 9.8 KB body that is a perfectly valid RSS 2.0 feed. A body-trusting
  parser ingests it; a status-checking parser drops it; neither of them SEES the
  disagreement, which is the actual finding.

  Trimmed to three items. The adapter's documented policy is that the status
  wins — the server is saying this resource does not exist, the canonical events
  RSS for this site is ?post_type=tribe_events&feed=rss2, and failing here lets
  issue 0014 republish yesterday's events rather than tonight's nothing. The body
  is still parsed, so the report can say exactly what was in it.
-->
